const brief=`JSM ASPIRE ACADEMY\nDISTRICT AI-READY SCHOOLS\nTeacher AI Upskilling & Student AI Activation Programme\n\nDISCUSSION BRIEF - PROPOSED PILOT\n\nPurpose\nEquip selected teachers of Classes 6-10 to introduce guided AI experiences in learning, creativity, exploration, career discovery and practical problem-solving. Responsible use, verification, privacy and critical thinking are built into first use.\n\nIllustrative coverage (not delivered results)\n25 schools; 100 teachers; 4 cohorts of 25 teachers; 500+ students to receive guided, hands-on exposure. A 32.5-hour practical teacher programme per cohort.\n\nDelivery sequence\n1. SELECT: Schools and teachers; proposed preparation 2-3 weeks.\n2. TRAIN: 32.5-hour practical programme per cohort.\n3. ACTIVATE: 4-8 weeks of teacher-led student activities.\n4. MEASURE: Outcomes, learning progression and district report; proposed reporting 1-2 weeks.\n\nWhat schools and the district retain\nTeacher AI Toolkit and classroom action plans; practical student activities; support toward relevant SOAR pathways, subject to applicable enrolment, assessment and certification requirements; a district report on teacher adoption, classroom use, student participation and progression.\n\nPoints to agree with the district\nSchool and teacher selection, academic-calendar fit, device and connectivity arrangements, venue, delivery responsibilities, final coverage, schedule, investment and funding route.\n\nImportant qualifications\nAll coverage numbers are illustrative planning assumptions. No agreed pilot, completed delivery, guaranteed certification, confirmed resource-person partnership or government endorsement is implied. The microsite's student Ari, teacher and lesson demonstrations are fictional and scripted, not a live AI service or actual programme results.\n\nProgramme basis\nSupplied JSM proposal: District AI-Ready Schools - Teacher AI Upskilling & Student AI Activation Programme.\n`;
$('#save-brief').addEventListener('click',()=>{const blob=new Blob([brief],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='District-AI-Ready-Schools-Discussion-Brief.txt';document.body.append(a);a.click();a.remove();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1500);$('#save-status').textContent='Discussion brief saved as a text file. No information was submitted.'});
renderLesson();measure();syncMotion();wake();
document.fonts?.ready.then(()=>queueMeasure());
